OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start for some, but
OL,6,Fotherwise another dry day. Soon
OL,7,Fturning warm or very warm with plenty
OL,8,Fof sunshine. Although some wispy high
OL,9,Fcloud may turn the sunshine hazy at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA warm evening with plenty of
OL,13,Flate sunshine. Staying largely dry
OL,14,Fovernight although the odd light
OL,15,Fshower can't be entirely ruled out.
OL,16,FWarmer than recent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
