OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FSmall chance of a brief shower
OL,6,Ffirst thing but otherwise another dry
OL,7,Fday is expected with prolonged periods
OL,8,Fof strong sunshine. Warmer than on
OL,9,FSaturday, perhaps hot for some.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FSomewhat cloudier and less hot Monday
OL,13,Fwith the outside chance of a light
OL,14,Fshower. Sunny and hot again Tuesday
OL,15,Fand Wednesday, especially inland.
OL,16,FBreezy at times along English Channel
OL,17,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
